		{
			dependencies: ["3944DD7AC4667137"]
			description: [
				"Before warping dimensions again, you should better familiarize with the &eMap Device&r."
				""
				"You may have already noticed that &esneak + right-clicking (empty hand)&r your &eMap Device&r brings up a huge tree. This is the &cAtlas&r, a progression-based system designed to encourage you to run various types of Maps."
				""
				"The pool of Maps you can roll is limited to Map nodes that are unlocked. Completing them unlocks more variants and &estarting with Tier 20+&r, rewards you with &c1 Atlas Passive&r."
				""
				"You can access the Atlas Passive tree by clicking the button in the top-left of the Atlas. Here, you can allocate points to &emodify how your Maps will behave&r."
			]
			id: "201E621A52FFCE65"
			rewards: [{
				auto: "enabled"
				command: "/mine_and_slash give exp @p 17500"
				elevate_perms: true
				icon: "ftb_ph:exp"
				id: "43413049B841CA66"
				silent: true
				title: "17500 Experience"
				type: "command"
