			}]
			title: "Dimensional Travel"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["201E621A52FFCE65"]
			description: ["As you're killing mobs and exploring the Map, you will notice your kill and loot percent increasing. These two metrics contribute to your total &eexploration rarity&r. The higher your exploration, the better the rewards will be for killing the &eMap Boss&r. As you explore more, your exploration rarity will start to go up, starting with &auncommon&r exploration as the first milestone."]
			icon: "minecraft:paper"
			id: "4983FE0DE8A1377F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "72DE3FED05338CB6"
				item: "mmorpg:currency/map_rarity_upgrade"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Lost Page"
			tasks: [{
				id: "743D361CB7F4E030"
				title: "Click Once Read"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Map Exploration"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["707C5CDB48B487F8"]
			description: [
				"While exploring &eThe Otherside&r, it may be prudent to go back to Maps to strengthen yourself. Luckily, you learned about empowered dimensions from your travels."
				""
				"Starting at &elevel 50&r, Maps can start rolling various &e\"League\"&r events that spice up the dungeon run. Complete these events for specialized rewards."
				""
				"Here is a brief overview of the 6 events you can encounter in Maps. You should already be familiar with &eHarvests&r and &eAncient Obeslisks&r!"
				""
				"1. &2Harvest&r - kill waves of enemies for powerful materials."
				"2. &cAncient Obelisks&r - survive the onslaught to earn currency."
				"3. &dProphecy&r - kill enemies in the Map to earn coins for a specialized shop."
				"4. &bImprisoned Monsters&r - unleash a powerful mob and kill it for potential rewards."
				"5. &7Strongboxes&r - kill the box's guardians for catered rewards."
				"6. &eShrines&r - use the shrine to provide yourself with powerful buffs."
				""
				"For more detail on each individual mechanic, you can refer to the connected &bLost Pages&r."
			]
			id: "7544F7A13E989534"
			rewards: [{
				auto: "enabled"
				command: "/mine_and_slash give exp @p 20000"
				elevate_perms: true
				icon: "ftb_ph:exp"
				id: "7B0CC44126435994"
				silent: true
				title: "20000 Experience"
				type: "command"
			}]
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Mapping"
			tasks: [{
				icon: "dungeon_realm:fixed_dungeon_map_item"
				id: "71F106101EBB87E1"
				stat: "mmorpg:dungeons_completed"
				type: "stat"
				value: 25
			}]
			title: "There's Levels to This..."
			x: 10.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7544F7A13E989534"]
			description: [
				"Within Mine and Slash Maps, there are additional events that can occur. Each Map &emay only have one mechanic active&r, unless you have special modifiers that allow for more. You will have already seen two of them which were available to spawn starting at level 50."
				""
				"&2Harvest&r (&bLv. 50+&r): find portals in Maps that will bring you to a new Harvest room. Kill mobs in these rooms to earn &eChaotic Gems&r which are used to craft special currencies!"
				""
				"&cAncient Obelisk&r (&bLv. 50+&r): similar to Harvest, find portals which will bring you to an arena. Tackle waves of enemies to find upgrades that can be used on &eObelisks&r! You'll also have the opportunity to earn special currency that can upgrade &eSupport and Augment Gems&r."
				""
				"&eShrines&r (&3Lv. 60+&r): find shrines throughout Maps that can be interacted with to provide yourself and nearby allies with a buff. This buff lasts 60s and can make a Map become trivial!"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:paper"
			id: "062656B385EA3960"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2F17F8F6DEB6F82D"
				item: "mmorpg:currency/map_rarity_upgrade"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Lost Page"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2266C44EDE1AE423"
				title: "Click Once Read"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "League Events"
			x: 10.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7544F7A13E989534"]
			description: [
				"Other events will start appearing at level 60. These also have a unique reward structure!"
				""
				"&dProphecy&r (&3Lv. 60+&r): interact with an altar to initiate &dProphecy&r. The altar allows you to choose from Curses that you can apply to yourself. While you have a Curse active, mobs will drop &eProphecy Coins&r. The more curses you have on yourself, the more &eProphecy Coins&r you can earn. Use these coins to purchase rewards in the Hub. Note that &6Legendary&r and &5Mythic&r rewards only appear starting in Tier 20 and 40 maps, respectively."
				""
				"&7Strongboxes&r (&3Lv. 60+&r): find &7Strongboxes&r throughout the Map. Interacting with one will summon &7Strongbox&r guardians. Defeat them, and reap specialized rewards. The rewards will consist of a pool of one type of item (eg. a bunch of &eCurrency&r, or a bunch of &eRunes&r)."
				""
				"&bImprisoned Monsters&r (&3Lv. 60+&r): sometimes in a Map, you'll run across a caged mob block. Interacting with it will free the mob which upon defeat, have a chance to drop special &eCurrency&r that can &erestore gear potential&r! Be warned though, these mobs are not for the faint of heart."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:paper"
			id: "747F8352825A124A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "64C505B09051A4A8"
				item: "mmorpg:map_creator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Lost Page"
			tasks: [{
				id: "17104BCDCBE1AF5F"
				title: "Click Once Read"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "League Events II"
			x: 12.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6DEBCC2B2DAE67AD"]
			description: [
				"Looking to challenge yourself even further? In addition to &cAtlas Passives&r, you can modify your Maps using &eRelics&r. By now, you should have quite a few &eRelics&r earned from chests and &eBoss&r kills. Use a &eRelic Key&r on a &eMap Device&r (or Harvest/Obelisk block) to access its &e\"Relic Inventory\"&r."
				""
				"In the inventory, you can place &eRelics&r to enhance the dungeon. Note that &cRelics have 3 uses before they're consumed&r and there is a limit to how many Relics you can place in a Map."
			]
			icon: "mmorpg:relic"
			id: "66226AD37A8822F0"
			rewards: [{
				auto: "enabled"
				command: "/mine_and_slash give exp @p 20000"
				elevate_perms: true
				icon: "ftb_ph:exp"
				id: "5B80ACDB0F87AF12"
				silent: true
