			}]
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Mapping"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1487955558F49FBC"
				item: "dungeon_realm:relic_key"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Relics of the Past"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6149D163ABF06A15"]
			description: [
				"You hear whispers of a powerful force deep in the void.. Continue exploring the &cAtlas&r and complete the toughest Maps to seek more information..."
				""
				"&cUber Maps&r are extremely difficult and rewarding Maps. A regular &5Tier 80+ Map&r can be upgraded into an &cUber Map&r using an &eAdventure Map Uber Upgrade&r item. You can craft these with &eUber Fragments&r which drop from Map Bosses."
				""
				"&cUber Maps&r contain &cUber Bosses&r, which drop very &epowerful Jewels&r."
				""
				"By finishing the &cAtlas&r, which requires the completion of &cUber Maps&r, you unlock the &oprivilege&r to challenge the &4Pinnacle Boss&r. Similar to an &cUber&r, you can craft the &eAdventure Map Pinnacle Upgrade&r item to modify your Map."
				""
				"&4Pinnacle Bosses&r are extremely difficult and also have a huge reward. But, &odo you have what it takes to find out what?&r"
			]
			id: "7DB451E643FAB7BE"
			rewards: [
